<title>KUWAIT: Kuwait private deposits up in May month/month.</title>
<headline>Kuwait private deposits up in May month/month.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Private sector deposits with banks in Kuwait rose to 7.350 billion dinars at the end of May, 1997 from 7.171 billion at the end of April, Central Bank figures showed.</p>
<p>The deposits stood at 7.082 billion in May 1996</p>
<p>			   Data in million dinars</p>
<p>				  May '97  April '97    May '96</p>
<p>Dinar deposits		6,091.8    5,795.8    5,673.5</p>
<p>Foreign currency deposits 1,257.7    1,375.0    1,408.4</p>
<p>($1 = 0.303 dinar)</p>
</text>
